invariant: INV-73
file: src/session.c
catches: tcp_nonblocking_loop_test
reason: a session wipes cfg.buf when it gives it back but keeps the pointer,
  so a later path that reached the buffer would read or write another
  connection's handshake instead of stopping.

--- old
    ct_wipe(t->cfg.buf, t->buf_written_len);
    t->cfg.buf = NULL;
--- new
    ct_wipe(t->cfg.buf, t->buf_written_len);
